{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f9f9a50d07237778d5c3a2e311b22ddabb3c3e0a771c6a2920885c6c9c749939", "ja": "（先日のステージで、美希はチアガールに扮し、\nライブを盛り上げてくれた……）", "zh": "（前些日子的舞台上，美希打扮成啦啦队女孩，为演出增添了热闹的气氛……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "6d5a937566165e28bba91ec71105fb888531233a96e330c9dc07d8d4b5f89913", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまなの～。\nあれ、なに見てるの？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦～  \n咦，你在看什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1002_p", "source_sha256": "86fa73b2d087c19407f278f5a8e0df23dcb9f9cc43850032bf36c2a48e731b4a", "ja": "お疲れ様、美希。\nこの前のライブ映像を確認してたんだ。", "zh": "辛苦了，美希。\n我在确认之前那场演出的影像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "8ac6a3d8c3ed09aa3f4d7ba6c396c15c714f5a16df64eefbb6f109db88a91b1e", "ja": "あ、チアガールの！　あのライブ、楽しかったよね～。\n衣装も可愛くて、みんなも大盛り上がりだったの♪", "zh": "啊，是啦啦队服的那场！那次演出很开心呢～\n服装也很可爱，大家都兴奋得不得了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6884d00aa3141f6c5eac61972020463d9e7205bc96206dbb8d9742a735a4398c", "ja": "うん。感想もたくさん来てるぞ。『美希ちゃんの\n応援があれば百万パワーで頑張れそうです！』って。", "zh": "嗯。也收到了很多感想。有人说：“有美希的加油，\n感觉就能凭百万的力量努力下去了！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "7fd01da1fa7463245731e6edd084b5c6c6113cb0ae24080166d143c99085f72e", "ja": "それはよかったの！　まあ、ミキの応援だし、\nそれくらいのパワーはトーゼンってカンジだけどね♪", "zh": "那太好了！毕竟是美希的加油嘛，这点力量当然是有的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1006_p", "source_sha256": "175a3e6f71d0f09bb15a38333c5698221f2b0ef1bd47f2bc9a8f6064a9c3bf5d", "ja": "はは、そうだな。美希に応援されたら、\n見てた人たちみんな、元気をもらえたと思うよ。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。被美希加油的话，\n我想在场的人应该都能打起精神来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "29fb6e9ba87cf82fbbd2dfe833265e170d14f0da4ea0a3171b25f3ae20ac7327", "ja": "ふぅん？　{$P$}も？", "zh": "哦？{$P$}也一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c1ecfdc97d83c7ecec2e6ffb3ff714a4ff8356a55f984aad445ae857deb8625d", "ja": "え？　あ、ああ……それはもちろん！", "zh": "诶？啊、啊啊……那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "10c8dbb140f362edb5b5eedbc3e50fd43d5c6c737b92632c4b313d17835c4fdc", "ja": "ホント？　それならミキが、ハニーのこと\nいっぱい応援してあげるの！", "zh": "真的？那样的话，美希会为亲爱的好好加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "7a5267ef7bcc8fe94144b2541d044096ff882d338a06cb76f1ffd926c8ec32b5", "ja": "フレーフレー、ハニー！　ミキのためにがんばれ～！\n……う～ん、なんか物足りない？", "zh": "加油加油，亲爱的！为了美希努力吧～！\n……唔～总觉得还差点什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c11a6c0d18da5f111caf65690b534e5f1ea72b415229b34ff1ca00b5c79dfe9b", "ja": "いや、今ので十分……。", "zh": "不，刚才那样就足够了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "691fd120cd9e935a1d41875e8cc4c4780c1c8ac0d24ce694b49abbf0c8cfd53c", "ja": "ううん。ミキ的には、もっと愛情たっぷりの\n応援じゃないとダメだって思うな。だから……。", "zh": "不行。美希觉得，不充满更多爱意\n来为你加油可不行呢。所以……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ee800917f5b065ce3752486c6414a7b62450b9e46ca2ffe5f65dfac168231be1", "ja": "あ、ありがとな、美希！　愛情はともかく……\nバッチリパワーをもらったよ。この後も頑張れそうだ！", "zh": "啊、谢谢你，美希！爱不爱的不说了……我可是得到了满满的力量。接下来也能继续努力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "64666375bca4f5981a10b8709651c281022d524d1b8eb0e34139b379ee52722b", "ja": "あはっ☆　なんだかミキ、嬉しくなってきたの！\nミキの応援のおかげで元気になったなら……。", "zh": "啊哈☆　美希总觉得好开心哦！\n既然美希的加油让你恢复了精力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "4f538676b32c823064d89ca2049d08bf2888e1236c2a15b655aca893442995b3", "ja": "ミキが、ハニー専属のチアガールになってあげよっか。\nそうすれば、一緒に過ごす時間ももっと増えるよね？", "zh": "要不要让美希当亲爱的专属啦啦队员呀？  \n这样一来，和你一起度过的时间也会更多，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b2ad4712cce6471dd79b508fb1993c6c966806bf0a9189f61be572e913a8003a", "ja": "それはそうだけど……。俺としては、\nもっとファンの人たちを応援してもらいたいな。", "zh": "话是这么说没错……不过对我来说，我更希望你能为更多粉丝加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1017_p", "source_sha256": "86a19e8a3a4c8cafb8e1509c1636862c2ee69b5573c7ccc179e8f3828f6f7b88", "ja": "アイドルとして輝く美希の姿が、俺の力になるから。", "zh": "作为偶像闪耀着的美希，正是我的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0563_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "1eac643fe9f1b28128e785dc73d3df20c56299afde5646eab1111112c4381108", "ja": "ハニー……。そういうことなら、わかったの。\nでも、ミキの応援がほしいときは、いつでも言ってね♪", "zh": "亲爱的……既然你这么说，我明白了。\n不过，如果你想要美希的支持，随时都可以告诉我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
